    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Halligan O`Connor proudly present \"Saileán,\" 8 Gormanston Meadows to the Stamullen property market. This beautifully presented four-bedroom detached family home extends to c. 169 sqm and is ideally located in the popular Gormanston Meadows development in Stamullen. Situated on a large plot of over 800 sqm, \"Saileán\" offers spacious and versatile accommodation with the added benefit of a substantial extension to the rear, creating a superb open-plan kitchen, dining and living space. Bright and airy, this impressive room features Velux windows and provides an ideal setting for everyday family life and entertaining.\n\nThe property enjoys an excellent level of privacy and is not overlooked to either the front or rear. Outside, the extra large c. 350 sqm mature rear garden offers plenty of space, while a paved patio provides an attractive area for outdoor dining and entertaining.\n\nThe ground-floor accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, home office, separate living room, sitting room, extended open-plan kitchen/dining/living area, laundry room and guest WC.\n\nUpstairs are four bedrooms, including three generous double bedrooms and one single bedroom. The primary bedroom benefits from an en-suite, while a family bathroom serves the remaining bedrooms.\n\nThe location is particularly convenient for families and commuters alike. Gormanston Train Station is close by, with both local and national bus services also easily accessible. The M1 motorway is within easy reach, providing excellent connectivity to Dublin and the wider north-east. Stamullen village and Gormanston Beach are both within walking distance, while St. Patrick`s National School and Gormanston College are also conveniently located nearby. \n\nStamullen is a thriving village that has retained its welcoming rural charm while offering the benefits of modern living. Gormanston Meadows is just minutes from the heart of the village, providing easy access to local amenities such as a national school, GAA complex, shops, chemist, pub/restaurant, hairdressers, and childcare facilities. The area is renowned for its strong community spirit, excellent sporting facilities, and beautiful surroundings. With the M1 just minutes away, travel times are exceptional: 35 minutes to Dublin, 20 to Swords, 25 to Dublin Airport, and just 15 minutes to Drogheda.\n\nContact Halligan O`Connor, Stamullen Estate Agents, to arrange a private viewing of this spacious and private four-bedroom detached home for sale in Stamullen.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hallway - 1.82m (6'0\") x 6.45m (21'2\")\nBright and welcoming entrance hall with quality flooring and an abundance of natural light.\n\nLiving Room - 3.61m (11'10\") x 6.75m (22'2\")\nElegant and spacious living room featuring a contemporary finish, abundant natural light and a stylish feature fireplace.\n\nOffice - 3.15m (10'4\") x 5.09m (16'8\")\nA spacious office space, ideal for remote working, study, and much more. Finished to an excellent standard.\n\nFamily Room - 3.71m (12'2\") x 6.88m (22'7\")\nbeautifully appointed family room offering a bright and versatile living space.\n\nKitchen - 5.21m (17'1\") x 4.69m (15'5\")\nOutstanding open - plan kitchen and dining area with modern fitted units, quality integrated appliances and ample space for family dining and entertaining.\n\nLaundry - 2.14m (7'0\") x 1.77m (5'10\")\nA well designed and practical laundry room with ample storage space, providing excellent additional household functionality.\n\nW/C - 1.95m (6'5\") x 1.25m (4'1\")\nA contemporary guest #wc finished with quality sanitary ware and stylish decor.\n\nDining Area - 5.19m (17'0\") x 3.57m (11'9\")\nA bright and elegant dining area, seamlessly connected to the kitchen, offering generous space for meals and entertaining, with a modern finish and views over the rear garden.\n\nLanding - 2.28m (7'6\") x 3.23m (10'7\")\nBright and spacious landing providing access to first floor amenities.\n\nBedroom 1 - 2.12m (6'11\") x 3.05m (10'0\")\nA spacious double bedroom with ample storage and floods of natural light.\n\nMain Bedroom - 3.3m (10'10\") x 4.11m (13'6\")\nGenerous main bedroom with ample storage, excellent natural light,\n\nEn Suite - 1.95m (6'5\") x 1.46m (4'9\")\nA modern, well - appointed en suite fitted with high quality sanitary ware.\n\nBedroom 2 - 2.53m (8'4\") x 3.14m (10'4\")\nA bright and spacious bedroom ideal for unwinding with ample storage\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.89m (9'6\") x 2.9m (9'6\")\nIn excellent decorative condition with ample storage\n\nBathroom - 2.8m (9'2\") x 1.91m (6'3\")\nSpacious family bathroom finished to a high standard\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Spacious 4-bedroom detached family home extending to approx. 169 sq. m. </li><li> Large private mature rear garden measuring c. 350 sqm with paved patio not overlooked </li><li> Gas Fired Central Heating </li><li> Impressive extended open-plan kitchen, dining and living area </li><li> Three double bedrooms and one single bedroom </li><li> Primary bedroom with en-suite </li><li> Separate living room, sitting room and home office </li><li> Walking distance to Stamullen village and Gormanston Beach </li><li> Close to Gormanston Train Station, bus routes and the M1 </li><li> Walking distance to St. Patrick`s National School and Gormanston College</li></ul>"
